      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    annual_lease_payment = 10000\n    interest_rate = 0.08\n    residual_value = 15000\n    num_periods = 5\n    lease_payments = [annual_lease_payment] * num_periods\n\n    # Calculate the present value of the lease payments and residual value\n    present_value_payments = sum(\n        payment / ((1 + interest_rate) ** period)\n        for period, payment in enumerate(lease_payments, start=1)\n    )\n    present_value_residual = residual_value / (\n        (1 + interest_rate) ** num_periods\n    )\n    answer = round(present_value_payments + present_value_residual)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
